Job Title: System Engineer – Intune / AD Administrator (Hybrid Onsite)
Location: Atlanta, GA (Locals Only)

Interview: Webcam or In-Person

Job Description
Seeking a System Engineer to manage and support endpoint and mobile device environments using Microsoft Intune, Azure/Entra ID, Active Directory, and Endpoint Configuration Manager. Responsible for application packaging, device administration, troubleshooting, system maintenance, and improving end-user support operations.
Key Responsibilities
Build and deploy application packages using Microsoft Intune.
Administer Azure, Entra ID, Active Directory, and endpoint devices.
Manage and troubleshoot laptops, desktops, and mobile devices.
Handle escalated technical issues and minimize service disruptions.
Develop support procedures, escalation processes, and technical documentation.
Monitor support KPIs, identify trends, and recommend improvements.
Provide technical guidance and training to support teams.
Required Skills
Hands-on experience with Microsoft Intune and Endpoint Management.
Azure Administration, Microsoft Entra ID, and Active Directory.
Windows 10/11 administration and troubleshooting.
Strong technical troubleshooting and customer support skills.
PowerShell scripting preferred.
Bachelor's degree and 3 years of relevant IT experience, or equivalent experience.
Preferred Skills
Microsoft 365, Teams, Outlook, and Copilot administration.
ServiceNow ticketing system.
Windows Server administration and patch management.
Hardware, software, printer, and mobile device support (Android/iOS).
Basic network troubleshooting (Ethernet and Wi-Fi).
Security, endpoint configuration, and inventory management.
Technical documentation and knowledge-base maintenance.


